        <section class="text-band">
            <h2>How I work</h2>
            <p>Most of my work ties deeply into the Swift language and Apple’s platforms. I enjoy working on each layer of a project, from the interface people see to the system services doing the heavy lifting, and the backend that keeps everything connected. I like owning the whole product because the pieces work better when they’re designed together.</p>
            <p>I care about software that feels clean, cohesive, and intuitive, whether it’s being used by a person, their assistive technology, or an AI agent. Clear structure, meaningful labels, and predictable interactions make software more accessible to all three.</p>
        </section>
    #endexport
#endextend
